silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_03_bridge_to_11_base_commutative_diagram_concrete_anchor_6_FelisCatusTSN183798#feliscatustsn183798 silm:hasLongDescription "The FelisCatusTSN183798 is the taxonomic species witness Felis catus, TSN 183798 from ITIS, supplying the taxonomy source leg into D_Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'FelisCatusTSN183798', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
